{
  "32": {
    "id": 32,
    "act": 2,
    "title": "One Last Time",
    "title_kr": "마지막으로 한 번 더",
    "file_rel_path": "act2/32_one_last_time.md",
    "characters_kr": [
      "알렉산더 해밀턴",
      "여성 앙상블",
      "조지 워싱턴"
    ],
    "characters_en": [
      "Alexander Hamilton",
      "Women",
      "George Washington"
    ],
    "stanzas": [
      {
        "key": "32:1",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Mr. President, you asked to see me?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:2",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "I know you’re busy"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:3",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "What do you need, sir? Sir?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:4",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "I wanna give you a word of warning"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:5",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Sir, I don’t know what you heard but whatever it is, Jefferson started it"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:6",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "Thomas Jefferson resigned this morning"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:7",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "You’re kidding"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:8",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "I need a favor"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:9",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Whatever you say, sir, Jefferson will pay for his behavior"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:10",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "Shh. Talk less"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:11-12",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "I’ll use the press",
          "I’ll write under a pseudonym, you’ll see what I can do to him—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:13",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "I need you to draft an address"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:14",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Yes! He resigned. You can finally speak your mind—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:15",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "No, he’s stepping down so he can run for President"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:16",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Ha. Good luck defeating you, sir"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:17",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "I’m stepping down. I’m not running for President"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:18",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "I’m sorry, what?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:19-25",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "One last time",
          "Relax, have a drink with me",
          "One last time",
          "Let’s take a break tonight",
          "And then we’ll teach them how to say goodbye",
          "To say goodbye",
          "You and I"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:26",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "No, sir, why?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:27",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "I wanna talk about neutrality"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:28",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Sir, with Britain and France on the verge of war, is this the best time—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:29",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "I want to warn against partisan fighting"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:30",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "But—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:31-33",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "Pick up a pen, start writing",
          "I wanna talk about what I have learned",
          "The hard-won wisdom I have earned"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:34-35",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "As far as the people are concerned",
          "You have to serve, you could continue to serve—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:36-41",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "No! One last time",
          "The people will hear from me",
          "One last time",
          "And if we get this right",
          "We’re gonna teach ‘em how to say goodbye",
          "You and I—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:42",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Mr. President, they will say you’re weak"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:43",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "No, they will see we’re strong"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:44",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Your position is so unique"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:45",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "So I’ll use it to move them along"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:46",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Why do you have to say goodbye?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:47-56",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "If I say goodbye, the nation learns to move on",
          "It outlives me when I’m gone",
          "Like the scripture says:",
          "“Everyone shall sit under their own vine and fig tree",
          "And no one shall make them afraid.”",
          "They’ll be safe in the nation we’ve made",
          "I wanna sit under my own vine and fig tree",
          "A moment alone in the shade",
          "At home in this nation we’ve made",
          "One last time"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:57",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "One last time"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:58-62",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Though, in reviewing the incidents of my administration, I am unconscious of intentional error, I am nevertheless too sensible of my defects not to think it probable that I may have committed many errors. I shall also carry with me",
          "The hope that my country will view them with indulgence",
          "And that after forty-five years of my life dedicated to its service with an upright zeal the faults of incompetent abilities will be consigned to oblivion, as I myself must soon be to the mansions of rest",
          "I anticipate with pleasing expectation that retreat in which I promise myself to realize the sweet enjoyment of partaking, in the midst of my fellow-citizens, the benign influence of good laws",
          "Under a free government, the ever-favorite object of my heart, and the happy reward, as I trust of our mutual cares, labors, and dangers."
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:63",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "One last time"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:64",
        "char_ids": [
          "21"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "여성 앙상블",
        "speaker_en": "Women",
        "lines": [
          "George Washington’s going home!"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:65",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Teach ‘em how to say goodbye"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "32:66-74",
        "char_ids": [
          "3"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 워싱턴",
        "speaker_en": "George Washington",
        "lines": [
          "You and I",
          "Going home",
          "History has its eyes on you",
          "We’re gonna teach ‘em how to say goodbye!",
          "Teach ‘em how to say",
          "Goodbye",
          "To say goodbye!",
          "Say goodbye!",
          "One last time!"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "33": {
    "id": 33,
    "act": 2,
    "title": "I Know Him",
    "title_kr": "난 그 친구 알지",
    "file_rel_path": "act2/33_i_know_him.md",
    "characters_kr": [
      "조지 3세"
    ],
    "characters_en": [
      "King George III"
    ],
    "stanzas": [
      {
        "key": "33:1-26",
        "char_ids": [
          "12"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "조지 3세",
        "speaker_en": "King George III",
        "lines": [
          "They say",
          "George Washington’s yielding his power and stepping away",
          "‘Zat true?",
          "I wasn’t aware that was something a person could do",
          "I’m perplexed",
          "Are they gonna keep on replacing whoever’s in charge?",
          "If so, who’s next?",
          "There’s nobody else in their country who looms quite as large…",
          "John Adams?!",
          "I know him",
          "That can’t be",
          "That’s that little guy who spoke to me",
          "All those years ago",
          "What was it, eighty-five?",
          "That poor man, they’re gonna eat him alive!",
          "Oceans rise",
          "Empires fall",
          "Next to Washington, they all look small",
          "All alone",
          "Watch them run",
          "They will tear each other into pieces",
          "Jesus Christ, this will be fun!",
          "Da da da dat da dat da da da da ya da",
          "Da da da dat dat da ya daaaaa!",
          "President John Adams",
          "Good Luck"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "34": {
    "id": 34,
    "act": 2,
    "title": "The Adams Administration",
    "title_kr": "애덤스 행정부",
    "file_rel_path": "act2/34_the_adams_administration.md",
    "characters_kr": [
      "아론 버",
      "앙상블 전체",
      "토머스 제퍼슨",
      "알렉산더 해밀턴",
      "제임스 매디슨"
    ],
    "characters_en": [
      "Aaron Burr",
      "Company",
      "Thomas Jefferson",
      "Alexander Hamilton",
      "James Madison"
    ],
    "stanzas": [
      {
        "key": "34:1-5",
        "char_ids": [
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "How does Hamilton the short-tempered protean creator of the Coast Guard",
          "Founder of the New York Post",
          "Ardently abuse his cab’net post",
          "Destroy his reputation?",
          "Welcome, folks, to"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "34:6",
        "char_ids": [
          "1",
          "24"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버, 앙상블 전체",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr, Company",
        "lines": [
          "The Adams administration!"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "34:7",
        "char_ids": [
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "Jefferson’s the runner-up, which makes him the Vice President"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "34:8",
        "char_ids": [
          "10"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson",
        "lines": [
          "Washington can’t help you now, no more mister nice President"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "34:9-10",
        "char_ids": [
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "Adams fires Hamilton",
          "Privately calls him “creole bastard” in his taunts"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "34:11",
        "char_ids": [
          "10"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson",
        "lines": [
          "Say what!"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "34:12",
        "char_ids": [
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "Hamilton publishes his response"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "34:13",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Sit down, John, you fat mother—BLEEP"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "34:14",
        "char_ids": [
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "Hamilton is out of control"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "34:15",
        "char_ids": [
          "11"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "제임스 매디슨",
        "speaker_en": "James Madison",
        "lines": [
          "This is great! He’s out of power. He holds no office. And he just destroyed President John Adams, the only other significant member of his party"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "34:16",
        "char_ids": [
          "10"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson",
        "lines": [
          "Hamilton’s a host unto himself. As long as he can hold a pen, he’s a threat. Let’s let him know what we know"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "35": {
    "id": 35,
    "act": 2,
    "title": "We Know",
    "title_kr": "우린 다 알고 있어",
    "file_rel_path": "act2/35_we_know.md",
    "characters_kr": [
      "알렉산더 해밀턴",
      "토머스 제퍼슨",
      "제임스 매디슨",
      "아론 버"
    ],
    "characters_en": [
      "Alexander Hamilton",
      "Thomas Jefferson",
      "James Madison",
      "Aaron Burr"
    ],
    "stanzas": [
      {
        "key": "35:1-4",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Mr. Vice President",
          "Mr. Madison",
          "Senator Burr",
          "What is this?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:5",
        "char_ids": [
          "10"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson",
        "lines": [
          "We have the check stubs. From separate accounts…"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:6",
        "char_ids": [
          "11"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "제임스 매디슨",
        "speaker_en": "James Madison",
        "lines": [
          "Almost a thousand dollars, paid in different amounts…"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:7",
        "char_ids": [
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "To a Mr. James Reynolds way back in seventeen ninety-one"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:8",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Is that what you have? Are you done?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:9",
        "char_ids": [
          "11"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "제임스 매디슨",
        "speaker_en": "James Madison",
        "lines": [
          "You are uniquely situated by virtue of your position—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:10",
        "char_ids": [
          "10"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson",
        "lines": [
          "Though ‘virtue’ is not a word I’d apply to this situation—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:11",
        "char_ids": [
          "11"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "제임스 매디슨",
        "speaker_en": "James Madison",
        "lines": [
          "To seek financial gain, to stray from your sacred mission—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:12",
        "char_ids": [
          "10"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson",
        "lines": [
          "And the evidence suggests you’ve engaged in speculation—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:13",
        "char_ids": [
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "An immigrant embezzling our government funds—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:14",
        "char_ids": [
          "10",
          "11"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨, 제임스 매디슨",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson, James Madison",
        "lines": [
          "I can almost see the headline, your career is done"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:15",
        "char_ids": [
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "I hope you saved some money for your daughter and sons"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:16",
        "char_ids": [
          "1",
          "10",
          "11"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버, 토머스 제퍼슨, 제임스 매디슨",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr, Thomas Jefferson, James Madison",
        "lines": [
          "Ya best g'wan run back where ya come from!"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:17",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Ha! You don’t even know what you’re asking me to confess"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:18",
        "char_ids": [
          "10",
          "11",
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨, 제임스 매디슨, 아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson, James Madison, Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "Confess"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:19-20",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "You have nothing. I don’t have to tell you anything at all",
          "Unless"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:21",
        "char_ids": [
          "10",
          "11",
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨, 제임스 매디슨, 아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson, James Madison, Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "Unless"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:22-23",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "If I can prove that I never broke the law",
          "Do you promise not to tell another soul what you saw?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:24",
        "char_ids": [
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "No one else was in the room where it happened"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:25",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Is that a yes?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:26",
        "char_ids": [
          "10",
          "11",
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨, 제임스 매디슨, 아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson, James Madison, Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "Um, yes"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:27-30",
        "char_ids": [
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "“Dear Sir, I hope this letter finds you in good health",
          "And in a prosperous enough position to put wealth",
          "In the pockets of people like me: down on their luck",
          "You see, it was my wife who you decided to—”"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:31",
        "char_ids": [
          "10"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson",
        "lines": [
          "Whaaaat—"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:32-45",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "She courted me",
          "Escorted me to bed and when she had me in a corner",
          "That’s when Reynolds extorted me",
          "For a sordid fee",
          "I paid him quarterly",
          "I may have mortally wounded my prospects but my papers are orderly!",
          "As you can see I kept a record of every check in my checkered history",
          "Check it again against your list n’ see consistency",
          "I never spent a cent that wasn’t mine",
          "You sent the dogs after my scent, that’s fine",
          "Yes, I have reasons for shame",
          "But I have not committed treason and sullied my good name",
          "As you can see I have done nothing to provoke legal action",
          "Are my answers to your satisfaction?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:46",
        "char_ids": [
          "10"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson",
        "lines": [
          "My God"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:47",
        "char_ids": [
          "11"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "제임스 매디슨",
        "speaker_en": "James Madison",
        "lines": [
          "Gentlemen, let’s go"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:48",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "So?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:49",
        "char_ids": [
          "10",
          "11"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "토머스 제퍼슨, 제임스 매디슨",
        "speaker_en": "Thomas Jefferson, James Madison",
        "lines": [
          "The people won't know what we know"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:50-52",
        "char_ids": [
          "2"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "알렉산더 해밀턴",
        "speaker_en": "Alexander Hamilton",
        "lines": [
          "Burr!",
          "How do I know you won’t use this against me",
          "The next time we go toe to toe?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "35:53",
        "char_ids": [
          "1"
        ],
        "speaker_kr": "아론 버",
        "speaker_en": "Aaron Burr",
        "lines": [
          "Alexander, rumors only grow. And we both know what we know"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
